A collection of my personal shell, Vim, Git, and GDB configuration files, along with an installation script to set them up on a new machine.

Files:
- `.bashrc`: Bash settings and aliases
- `.zshrc`: Zsh settings and aliases
- `.vimrc`: Vim editor configuration
- `.gdbinit`: GDB debugger settings
- `.gitconfig`: Git configuration and aliases
- `install.sh`: Script to install the configuration files





